Project Title

GeneWeaver: GPU-Accelerated CRISPR Alignment Engine

Internship Details

- Company: Infotact Solutions
- Internship Role: Data Associate L1 Intern
- Domain: Python Development
- Project Start Date: 10 November 2026
- Project End Date: 10 December 2026
